    <briefdescription>
<para>SSL/TLS服务器类 </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>实现SSL/TLS加密的TCP服务器，使用ssl_acceptor接受连接。</para>
<para>使用示例： <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>创建SSL服务器</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classssl__server_1ab626ef1e654653245dd259bb125bf771" kindref="member">ssl_server</ref><sp/>server(443,<sp/>10);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>加载证书</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">if</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(!server.load_certificate(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;server.crt&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;server.key&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">))<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><ref refid="group___console_i_o_1gadd269b1d24f35618e1eb0ea848dbf6a0" kindref="member">println</ref>(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;Failed<sp/>to<sp/>load<sp/>certificate&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>设置客户端处理器</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">server.set_client_handler([](unique_ptr&lt;tcp_socket&gt;<sp/>client)<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>client<sp/>is<sp/>polymorphic<sp/>—<sp/>ssl_socket<sp/>methods<sp/>work<sp/>via<sp/>virtual<sp/>dispatch</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>client-&gt;send_all({</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;response&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">});</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">});</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>启动服务器</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">server.start();</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
